    {
      "text": "After creating an outegration in the Agentic Security Operations Platform (Agentic SecOps Platform), you can manage and monitor it from the Outegrations page. This page provides a centralized view of all configured outegrations in your account."
    },
    {
      "text": "When managing outegrations, you can perform the following actions:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Edit Outegration Mapping",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Edit Outegration Details and Settings",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Delete an Outegration",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Clone an Outegration",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Deactivate an Outegration",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "See Activity Log",
      "depth": 0
    }
  ]
